< @XYZ > V3.4 e  Super Formulator for Psion Series 3a. Shareware

NEW: English version. (c) Jacques GAUDIN 1995-96

New version with a new and nice graphic interface and choice of special keys.
You can store many formulas in thematic files (with seven variables) like:
Z=sqr(R**2+((L*2*Pi*f)-1/(C*2*Pi*f))**2)
You can use them after with the possibility to write on calculator memories 
(replace, add or substract) and recall them like variable entry. 
You can export results to a file or a printer !
Many examples. Support all internal functions of OPL 
and new functions like MOD (modulo), FACT (n!) and so on.
Read @XYZ.WRD (ASCII) for more information.
